    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with her consent. She named a health care agent, recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here, and said that if she were ever too ill to decide, she would want her agent to know her wish to keep the chance of having children wherever possible. She chose not to record other treatment preferences today. To be revisited yearly. [S]</paragraph></text>

